[{"title":"麻姑山次万长史韵二首 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"景与情俱胜，人归酒未阑。\n舆分秋籁爽，桥倚晚淙寒。\n石鼎诗中纪，兰亭画里看。\n好山游欲遍，东望眼初宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46316,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次许给事启衷九日感怀因以为赠二首 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"南极开天诏，春来万物苏。\n节随星动速，槎向海浮迂。\n鲲运溟风翼，龙收渥水驹。\n故园聊暂驻，松菊未曾芜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46317,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次许给事启衷九日感怀因以为赠二首 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"贾涕频封疏，因诗复一号。\n风尘人落落，江汉日滔滔。\n径晚菊生色，庭秋鹤毨毛。\n玉峰青琐外，何处赋登高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46318,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南安谒濂溪先生祠","author":"邵宝","text":"一脉濂溪水，中涵太极天。\n契符三圣后，冠冕四儒前。\n庭谒初除草，峰寻几问莲。\n略谙光霁在，有笔未能传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46319,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"邵宝","text":"听雨山中寺，萧条对佛灯。\n春怀偏恼客，野兴未嫌僧。\n雷似千峰动，泉应一夜增。\n壮心方激烈，静坐欲飞腾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46320,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王敬止使朝鲜卷","author":"邵宝","text":"玉树挺高标，绯袍敕度辽。\n风传箕子国，星动汉官轺。\n沈斥春回蚤，封疆晓望遥。\n清名满东裔，疋马自还朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46321,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐文靖公挽词","author":"邵宝","text":"公为苍生恸，私还哭所知。\n名成归老日，功在荐贤时。\n风采山中杖，文章海内碑。\n向来参谒地，风动古槐枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46322,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登白云阁待友不至","author":"邵宝","text":"路左离亭北，幽寻兴亦多。\n偶登仙阁坐，又听道童歌。\n云远双峰出，林深一鸟过。\n长吟无和者，奈此素秋何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46323,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋溪卷","author":"邵宝","text":"潢潦初收尽，寒泉走白沙。\n云来疑雁影，雪舞爱芦花。\n有客同书舫，何人独钓槎。\n沧浪才两语，歌起水无涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46324,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慧山寺次姚少师韵","author":"邵宝","text":"十年酬远兴，秋晚寺门开。\n山色空中落，泉声起处来。\n草香寻异品，树老问初栽。\n欲为茶神酹，还将酒一杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46325,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻西园叔讣","author":"邵宝","text":"素守邱樊节，无书谒贵人。\n占从閒处熟，吟到醉时真。\n北渚鸿何晚，西园草又春。\n正怀家国念，闻讣益沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46326,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题观松卷","author":"邵宝","text":"散步古松阴，清风吹满襟。\n雨滋萝薜密，云隐茯苓深。\n静对宁须臆，真知只在心。\n寒岩梅竹畔，更许一相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46327,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠毛渊之","author":"邵宝","text":"寒风吹客衣，之子正东归。\n云影连蓬岛，江光动少微。\n天边栖凤沼，海上钓鱼矶。\n折得梅花在，还将寄北扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46328,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过龟山","author":"邵宝","text":"渎庙龟山顶，长淮日夜东。\n放船方海月，挂席更天风。\n鬼物荒唐里，神功镇静中。\n济川吾岂敢，斯道正无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46329,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答杨仪部","author":"邵宝","text":"驱驰山水国，野兴入秋多。\n佳处每十宿，浩然时一歌。\n渡江乘月坐，题石带云磨。\n为问南峰主，相逢谓我何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46330,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"德兴思家","author":"邵宝","text":"正是思家地，山中更雨中。\n林明初得月，泉响半因风。\n卧榻辰瞻北，巡车道指东。\n慈闱无一字，何处问来鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46331,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访舒方伯本直","author":"邵宝","text":"细雨深山路，高风勇退人。\n骨同仙入相，心与道为邻。\n白发霜馀少，丹崖眼底真。\n归舟逐烟水，回首已迷津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46332,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次杨澹成新春感怀韵","author":"邵宝","text":"喜雪还愁雪，人将谓我何。\n不堪雷太蚤，况复雨兼多。\n黄鸟声全涩，红梅色半酡。\n凭谁吹古律，一笑转阳和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46333,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将赴许州奉别西涯先生","author":"邵宝","text":"我有文章愿，公今海内师。\n南畿叨荐日，东阁听谈时。\n地重怜才甚，名高入相迟。\n茫茫离与合，何以尽心期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46334,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送邹光大","author":"邵宝","text":"分手金台下，东南望故乡。\n春随三月尽，水入五湖长。\n爱石焚香拜，评泉挟茗尝。\n风光看不了，一一付奚囊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46335,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵寄陆兵侍","author":"邵宝","text":"仗剑风尘地，皇言属汝为。\n一书知胜算，三月定还期。\n露檄晨驰遽，围棋夜卧迟。\n凯歌催布谷，草绿雨丝丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46336,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻工侍徐公讣","author":"邵宝","text":"千里闻公讣，悲深吊却难。\n客衣新泪湿，宾馆旧盟寒。\n南国兴居重，东门进退宽。\n诔词书不尽，江水易为乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46337,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过天津见新筑台","author":"邵宝","text":"台起孤城外，风尘地有馀。\n奔鲸惊筑观，飞鸟避储胥。\n鸥白连渔浦，杨青引漕渠。\n它年志兵卫，史笔定联书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46338,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过沧州","author":"邵宝","text":"指点沧州路，秋来屡受攻。\n一言符间法，数矢奏奇功。\n败屋寒灰后，荒城野浸中。\n鱼盐近何价，欲问海滨翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46339,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"德州","author":"邵宝","text":"北路临流郡，南来奉使身。\n将怜初领地，器问旧藏人。\n独立金汤险，先登矢石亲。\n盗平看出猎，春草四郊新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46340,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜遇高县尹","author":"邵宝","text":"独行寒夜清，惊乌时一鸣。\n相逢即相别，翻使客愁生。\n微论开新瘴，幽怀抱宿酲。\n临分还致语，侧耳听贤声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46341,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清源别吴马二生","author":"邵宝","text":"卫水西风急，将归客去时。\n愁难禁下拜，苦不会成诗。\n三月师应老，诸州盗未夷。\n慈闱问消息，言喜莫言悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46342,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二生临行得家信","author":"邵宝","text":"正恨慈闱远，如何动笑颜。\n一书三月至，千里两人还。\n岁月它乡误，风尘此道艰。\n何时拜家庆，春酒对云山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46343,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临清都府感旧","author":"邵宝","text":"宪府荒城里，重门倚茂林。\n壮怀天地阔，旧梦岁年深。\n月幌思秋霁，风檐坐夕阴。\n静中军国计，一日几经心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46344,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚至临清","author":"邵宝","text":"汶水穷诸闸，西来更卫川。\n堤黄犹有柳，浸白已无莲。\n驿骑冲残日，城鸦起宿烟。\n时时闻盗警，烽火似三边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46345,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武城夜泊","author":"邵宝","text":"日暮路堪愁，长河正北流。\n风声城上柝，星影驿边舟。\n贤宰怀前辈，儒官感旧游。\n黎明促南发，漕卒正焦头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46346,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"跃马泉","author":"邵宝","text":"跃马泉何在，西岩洞北头。\n无疆坤亦健，有本坎还流。\n块历风争骤，空行雪避遒。\n百年谁执御，江汉日悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46347,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸公以将石联句为赠次韵以答","author":"邵宝","text":"泉已离山久，谁教冽且寒。\n无形成砥柱，有价比琅玕。\n重在移时试，清从激处看。\n不妨江海上，风雨落花残。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46348,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泉亭卷","author":"邵宝","text":"此泉天下胜，公乃爱泉人。\n吾道今犹古，空亭秋复春。\n眼明曾作鉴，心渴几生尘。\n最喜前川水，泠然却近真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46349,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答王进士演之","author":"邵宝","text":"才短惭乡国，君胡问谢安。\n自缘忧世切，谁谓识人难。\n行卷诗俱漫，离杯酒独乾。\n相思江汉外，回首朔云寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46350,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匏翁东庄杂咏九首 其一 东城","author":"邵宝","text":"有圃城东偏，石梁度幽径。\n隐然见东城，不见东山胜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46351,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匏翁东庄杂咏九首 其二 竹田","author":"邵宝","text":"楚云梦潇湘，卫水歌淇澳。\n吴城有竹田，亦有人如玉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46352,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匏翁东庄杂咏九首 其三 南港","author":"邵宝","text":"南渡通西湖，晚多渔艇宿。\n人家深树中，青烟起茅屋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46353,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匏翁东庄杂咏九首 其四 桑洲","author":"邵宝","text":"汲溪灌桑树，叶多蚕亦稠。\n衣被尽天下，美哉真此洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46354,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匏翁东庄杂咏九首 其五 全真馆","author":"邵宝","text":"何处适馀兴，寻师谈道经。\n隔桥云满屋，钟磬晚泠泠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46355,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匏翁东庄杂咏九首 其六 耕息轩","author":"邵宝","text":"陇上阅耕罢，北窗清卧风。\n豳诗读未了，梦已见周公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46356,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匏翁东庄杂咏九首 其七 鹤洞","author":"邵宝","text":"老鹤爱云栖，石洞自天凿。\n秋风时一声，飞云散寥廓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46357,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匏翁东庄杂咏九首 其八 朱樱径","author":"邵宝","text":"叶间缀朱实，实落绿成阴。\n一步还一摘，不知苔径深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46358,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匏翁东庄杂咏九首 其九 曲池","author":"邵宝","text":"曲池如曲江，水清花可怜。\n池上木芙蓉，红映池中莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46359,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"邵宝","text":"日暮风雨恶，咫尺不可去。\n危桥下马过，犹胜无桥处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46360,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上口占二首 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"不到西湖上，于今二十年。\n相逢多白发，山色只如前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46361,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上口占二首 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"画船入西湖，风光正春暮。\n指点两峰云，先寻岳王墓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46362,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松下作二首 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"泉流古松下，松影流不去。\n时方望云霓，谁留卧龙住。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46363,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松下作二首 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"孤笛横秋江，一声山月白。\n芦花起天风，萧瑟溪南北。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46364,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"银河天上来，不复上天去。\n千载乘槎人，应迷问津处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46365,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"偶来坐松下，爱此流泉声。\n云山隔遥浦，悠然空复情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46366,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江曲","author":"邵宝","text":"春色将归去，江南草正新。\n南风亦何意，偏脑欲归人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46367,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有待","author":"邵宝","text":"芳洲草青青，云水半吞吐。\n前船已过湖，还听后船橹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46368,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴嗣业","author":"邵宝","text":"茶香邻酒国，知味各称仙。\n何日携茶具，云山共我泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46369,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题文徵明画","author":"邵宝","text":"于画见书法，萧然无滞情。\n君看片石畔，丛竹忽生生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46370,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨过独坐","author":"邵宝","text":"暑雨过不尽，斜阳穿湿云。\n雷声近还远，隐隐隔江闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46371,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为钱忠言题画","author":"邵宝","text":"偶舣北来棹，淮阴听晚钟。\n明朝渡江去，秋浦采芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46372,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和溪为程进士赋","author":"邵宝","text":"家住万山中，云峰翠几重。\n东山朝日出，望见海霞红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46373,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"邵宝","text":"清风何飘飖，左盻澄江湘。\n天高万物肃，松柏郁芒芒。\n通波激柱渚，大道夷且长。\n愿为双鸣鹤，施翮起高翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46374,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遇王参政汝言","author":"邵宝","text":"兰泽多芳草，引领遥相晞。\n河汉清且浅，愁思当告谁。\n我有一尊酒，客从远方来。\n临河濯长缨，乐饮不知疲。\n努力崇明德，馀光照我衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46375,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述怀","author":"邵宝","text":"东园桃与李，白日忽蹉跎。\n左右佩双璜，徙倚引芳柯。\n寒衣欲谁待，春风扇微和。\n齐心同所愿，结根太山阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46376,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思","author":"邵宝","text":"兰荣一何晚，向风长叹息。\n褰裳欲从之，磷磷水中石。\n西游咸阳中，入道逢深识。\n驾鸿乘紫烟，高举振六翮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46377,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻时事有感集李四首 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"松柏本孤直，翠绿如芙蓉。\n独立自萧飋，楚山邈千重。\n安知天汉上，乘云驾轻鸿。\n沈叹终永夕，世无洗耳翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46378,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻时事有感集李四首 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"吾衰竟谁陈，焉得偶君子。\n倚楼青云端，千春隔江水。\n大雅思文王，行行未能已。\n鸑鷟有时鸣，雄断自天启。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46379,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻时事有感集李四首 其三","author":"邵宝","text":"长鲸正崔嵬，世路有屈曲。\n自挟两青龙，挥手折若木。\n沿芳剧春洲，凤饥不啄粟。\n楼船几时回，秋露白如玉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46380,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻时事有感集李四首 其四","author":"邵宝","text":"明月出海底，回风送天声。\n宝剑双蛟龙，虚步蹑太清。\n云卧游八极，三公运权衡。\n努力保霜雪，群才属休明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46381,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中怀李方伯惟诚集杜二绝 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"老去才难尽，秋天忆射雕。\n白鸥波浩荡，寒水不成潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46382,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中怀李方伯惟诚集杜二绝 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"海内知名士，如公复几人。\n千秋一拭泪，鼓柂视青旻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46383,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赐大明会典","author":"邵宝","text":"缃函新捧出天衢，十载文光照石渠。\n唐作一经徒托语，周遗六典始成书。\n圣神功化三才里，今昔经纶万卷馀。\n遐想先皇初诏日，洞观千古欲何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46384,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醴陵旋节","author":"邵宝","text":"三月湘东应召还，君恩免过万重山。\n正缘岐路生愁思，总为庭闱动笑颜。\n云与新篇封石壁，风随旧节度江关。\n百年报答知何地，只在丹心一寸间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46385,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歌风台","author":"邵宝","text":"欲上高台水漫波，向来遗恨付长河。\n雄图自谓千年少，猛士犹嫌一语多。\n白日无端江草合，赤龙何在野云过。\n登临更作它时约，却向中流听棹歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46386,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨","author":"邵宝","text":"江寒五月拥重衾，雨滴空阶夜夜深。\n无地诛求贫到骨，有人恸哭苦关心。\n百川何处堪回砥，三日它年本作霖。\n坐对青灯头欲白，敢言吾道在山林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46387,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟游慈恩寺用涯翁韵","author":"邵宝","text":"春残才作探春行，古寺寻僧懒问名。\n近海景多频立马，对花情剧更闻莺。\n镜湖敢乞君分赐，宝地偏教佛主盟。\n却忆江南如画里，万峰青接水边城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46388,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒文信国祠","author":"邵宝","text":"春色无端满地莎，伤心燕市偶经过。\n清风又读忠臣传，白日如闻正气歌。\n社稷一身惟死是，纲常千古有功多。\n瓣香未了平生拜，回首荒祠独奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46389,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]